<title>SOUTH KOREA: Samsung wins $50 mln Indian order.</title>
<headline>Samsung wins $50 mln Indian order.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Samsung Engineering Co Ltd said on Tuesday it had won a $50 million gas plant order from Indian Petrochemicals Corp Ltd .</p>
<p>The construction in Gujarat in midwest India is scheduled to be completed by July 1999, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The order was awarded on a turn-key basis, it said.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
